<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Momoko Goto is the culprit, you say.<PG>
It is also curious that at the end, she, who had almost no involvement in the incident, was strangely well informed about how the incident unfolded.<PG>
Besides, she was in the Goto home, the very place where Haruka Niimura consulted Erina Goto, so gathering information would be easy as well.<PG>
Well, if she says she heard it from the police, that is the end of it, but the fact that Erina Goto noticed something on hearing her words... perhaps she knows something.<PG>
The Momoko Goto culprit theory, I would like to hear <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's deeper analysis of it.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
